            "review_title": "Review at Caribe Rock Burguer",
            "review_text": "Trek07654465298\n1 contribution\n0\nCome here and eat, forget the other places!\nDec 2025 • Couples\nAmazing homemade pizza with pepperoni!! The juiciest burger (with beef, egg and ham?) I’ve ever eaten! It’s the best meal we’ve had on this trip. The cocktails are very good to, we order Cuba Libre and Mojito.\nWe have 6 days left on the island, and we will 100% definitely come back many times. It was absolutely fantastic.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 24, 2025",
